{"overview":"مرتضی وقتی پدرش را از دست می‌دهد، مجبور می‌شود مدرسه را ترک کرده در مزرعه کار کند. او عاشق گلرخ می‌شود؛ پس از ازدواج، گلرخ اصرار دارد مرتضی تحصیلاتش را تمام کند و به دانشگاه ثبت‌نام کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Morteza When he loses his father, he's forced to leave school and work in the fields. He falls in love with Golrokh, After getting married, Golrokh insists that Morteza finish school and sign up for college.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":22,"y":2011,"poster":""}],"episodes":22,"crew":["Fereidoun Hasanpour"],"crew_en":[],"countries":[],"cast":[{"name":"Mohammad Reza Foroutan","role":"Morteza/Shamsollah","photo":"/rZqwR0L3iyrnn01IfzULk4ZqYGP.jpg"},{"name":"بهنوش طباطبایی","role":"Mina Naderi","photo":"/jSNkdZi6RIXSNpOZHVlmx0sq7TN.jpg","en":"Behnoosh Tabatabaei"},{"name":"Sepideh khodaverdi","role":"Golrokh (Javani)","photo":""},{"name":"Siavash Kheirabi","role":"Maziyar Esfandiari","photo":"/3DujO2Q3ANQxT2NkJpmz2nxBhUm.jpg"},{"name":"فریبا نادری","role":"Nazi","photo":"/m576faIqJPBM6iJqwPwQByw1xhu.jpg","en":"Fariba Naderi"},{"name":"هومن کیایی","role":"Ahmad","photo":"/5KOvJfBp6FvgNGWgUu04aWUpvl7.jpg","en":"Houman Kiai"},{"name":"Bijan Afshar","role":"Pedar-e Mina","photo":"/77dZm11QztFa3YxYNou3kFtM8xa.jpg"},{"name":"Sara Monjezi","role":"Sara","photo":"/rSWyxQoE1a4Yqtb4iAJrihwAYxp.jpg"},{"name":"Amir Nouri","role":"Yadollah","photo":"/kA0TJmzNgNxMnOblGbc8mSaXTrR.jpg"},{"name":"Fatemeh Sadeghi","role":"Golrokh (Miyansali)","photo":""},{"name":"Ahmad Aghaei","role":"Morteza/Ali (Javani)","photo":""},{"name":"رضا ناجی","role":"Karam","photo":"/lO7H6c1ArDhS6WYvDPnz9meQtLW.jpg","en":"Reza Naji"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":["s70785"],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/329083"}